repository-code: https://github.com/PedroLormendez/jcclass
url: https://github.com/PedroLormendez/jcclass
abstract: >
  jcclass is a Python package that implements the gridded Jenkinson-Collison
  Classification (JCC) to compute synoptic circulation types from gridded
  mean sea-level pressure (MSLP) data. It classifies atmospheric circulation
  into 27 types (or 11 aggregated types) based on dominant MSLP features
  such as cyclones, anticyclones, and their associated wind flow directions.
